This series adds verification of CPER record headers by consuming the 
xe_error_cper trace event exposed through tracefs. 

It verifies the existence of trace events and supports enable/disable 
control of the trace. It then captures and parses the trace event 
generated by querying the get_error_counter netlink API. 

It validates key fields in the CPER Record Header, CPER Section Descriptor,
Intel Public Error Header and Intel Private Error Info.

The tracefs-dependent tests are skipped when the xe_error_cper event is unavailable.

